{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今（19日）凌晨1時許，警方紅磡特遣隊在區內巡邏，期間在大環道發現一輛私家車停泊在上址，形跡可疑，遂上前截查，調查期間在車內發現約20包懷疑可卡因。警方隨即拘捕該名年約20多歲的男司機，他涉嫌「販運危險藥物」，現正被扣留調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"警方拘捕該名年約20多歲的男司機，他涉嫌「販運危險藥物」，現正被扣留調查。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188672566307590144914580.jpeg/Xa-jTIokBvmCr5TnfN0DtPhBn6aU0sXFhDVfsq41X7I\"/><figcaption>警方拘捕該名年約20多歲的男司機，他涉嫌「販運危險藥物」，現正被扣留調查。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"調查期間在車內發現約20多包懷疑可卡因。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188672562968793088289076.jpeg/eiIwNkX-G1jmU4JNYzCOP5bdom3RSZ6F24kv3_GJL98\"/><figcaption>調查期間在車內發現約20多包懷疑可卡因。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"調查期間在車內發現約20多包懷疑可卡因。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188672559453835264609541.jpeg/ueZnKKeT6KNvzoqFEs07J5hSFyALNl7WhsBseqzAbHo\"/><figcaption>調查期間在車內發現約20多包懷疑可卡因。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T18:18:43.016371+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T18:13:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T07:58:04.126187+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T18:17:37.123241+00:00","content_hash":"06b8210f32a064c98e9a700eb5ed523bcb6c409f26bb9d1b55975d76f3657477","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}